---
description: Supabase + Postgres conventions
globs:
  - "**/migrations/**"
  - "**/db/**"
  - "**/infra/supabase/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Supabase / Postgres rules

- All migrations are reversible (up + down)
- Migration names: `YYYYMMDDHHMM_<verb>_<noun>.sql`
- RLS enabled on all tables; deny by default
- Columns: snake_case; tables: plural, snake_case (users, agent_traces)
- pgvector: `ivfflat` index with `lists = sqrt(rows)`
- Schemas mirrored in TypeScript via `infra/supabase/schemas.ts` (Zod)
- NEVER: SQL in strings with interpolation; use parameterized queries
